"""The catalogue moves from inventory to catalog WITHOUT copying data: the
models keep their inventory_* tables (Meta.db_table) and their ids, so this
migration only changes Django's state (SeparateDatabaseAndState with no
database operation). Their ContentTypes move to the catalog app label (the
permissions and the groups that hold them stay the same rows), and every
Entity that uses the catalogue today (inventory, sales, purchases or farmacia
active) gets the catalog module active. The reverse undoes both."""
